Nb4 a5 { [%emt 0:00:40] [%think 2827] [%out 3130] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0]
[%cachewrite 1848] **Material and threats:** Black has a bishop, two knights
and two queenside pawns. White has a rook, a bishop and a knight. Material is
roughly level, but Black's connected passed pawns on a6/b5 are the long-term
trump. **The move:** a6-a5 attacks the white knight and pushes the pawns
forward with tempo. - **Nc6:** the a5 pawn is defended by the c7 bishop. Black
can then continue with b5-b4 or Bb6. - **Nd5:** exd5 wins the knight. -
**Nd3:** Black trades with Nxd3 Rxd3, simplifying while keeping two connected
passed pawns. - **Na2 or Nc2:** the knight becomes passive, and Black can push
b4 with the pawn chain protected by a5. Rd8+ is not a worry, because d8 is
covered by the c7 bishop. } 33. Nc6 b4 { [%emt 0:00:29] [%think 2030]
[%out 2265] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0] [%cachewrite 1869] **思路：** 子力大致相当，
我方是车换马加两兵的格局。黑方的主要优势是后翼的 a、b 联兵。 **安全检查：** -
白方的 Rd8+ 可以用 Bxd8 吃掉，不构成威胁。 - 白马吃 a5 兵时，c7 象能回吃。 - 走
b4 后，b4 兵有 a5 兵保护，白马吃 b4 会被 axb4 回吃。 - c5 马和 f6
马目前都没有受到攻击。 **计划：** 推 b 兵，下一步再配合 a4、b3 继续推进，
让白车疲于防守。 } 34. Rc1 Nd3 { [%emt 0:00:38] [%think 2818] [%out 3065]
[%in 2] [%cacheread 0] [%cachewrite 1893] **思路：** 白车 c1
